  "description": "<div style=\"font-family: Poppins;\"><h2 data-start=\"182\" data-end=\"219\" id=\"isPasted\"><strong data-start=\"185\" data-end=\"219\">Upcycle Dog® Affiliate Program</strong></h2><p data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"311\"><strong data-start=\"221\" data-end=\"311\">Join us in giving materials a second life — and making dogs look great while we do it.</strong></p><p data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"678\">Upcycle Dog® creates <strong data-start=\"334\" data-end=\"366\">unique, small-batch dog gear</strong> made from <strong data-start=\"377\" data-end=\"415\">reclaimed and repurposed materials</strong> like retired climbing rope, recycled fleece, and parachute fabric. Every product is <strong data-start=\"500\" data-end=\"527\">handcrafted in Colorado</strong>, and no two pieces are ever the same. When you share Upcycle Dog®, you’re helping keep useful materials out of landfills while supporting U.S. makers.</p><h3 data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"706\"><strong data-start=\"684\" data-end=\"706\">Affiliate Benefits</strong></h3><p data-start=\"707\" data-end=\"996\">•&nbsp;<strong data-start=\"709\" data-end=\"738\">Earn up to 15% commission</strong> on every sale<br data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"755\">• 45<strong data-start=\"757\" data-end=\"781\">-day cookie window</strong> (plenty of time to convert your audience)<br data-start=\"823\" data-end=\"826\">• Free social media content &amp; product storytelling tips<br data-start=\"881\" data-end=\"884\">• Early access to new gear drops and seasonal colors<br data-start=\"936\" data-end=\"939\">• Optional product gifting for high-performing partners</p><h3 data-start=\"998\" data-end=\"1030\"><strong data-start=\"1002\" data-end=\"1030\">Who We Love Working With</strong></h3><p data-start=\"1031\" data-end=\"1299\">• Dog owners who live active, outdoor lifestyles<br data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1082\">• Pet enthusiasts, trainers, shelter/rescue supporters<br data-start=\"1136\" data-end=\"1139\">• Hikers, cyclists, van-lifers, trail lovers<br data-start=\"1183\" data-end=\"1186\">• Small content creators with highly engaged audiences<br data-start=\"1240\" data-end=\"1243\">• People who care about sustainability and craftsmanship</p><h3 data-start=\"1301\" data-end=\"1318\"><strong data-start=\"1305\" data-end=\"1318\">Your Role</strong></h3><p data-start=\"1319\" data-end=\"1485\">Share your genuine experiences with our gear — show your dog living life, getting dirty, exploring, napping, whatever makes them <em data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1454\">them</em>. Authenticity &gt; sales tactics.</p><h3 data-start=\"1487\" data-end=\"1506\"><strong data-start=\"1491\" data-end=\"1506\">Our Promise</strong></h3><p data-start=\"1507\" data-end=\"1607\">We’ll back you with real support, clear communication, and products that truly hold up to adventure.</p><p data-start=\"1609\" data-end=\"1670\">Join us. Help dogs look good. Help the planet breathe easier.</p><p data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1720\"><strong data-start=\"1672\" data-end=\"1720\">Upcycle Dog® — Give materials a second life.</strong></p></div>",
